#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Home Assistant turned that down for the lights. Check the device in Home Assistant."
msgstr "O Home Assistant recusou isso para as luzes. Verifique o dispositivo no Home Assistant."

#: src/lib.rs
msgid "Home Assistant couldn't get the lights to do that. Check the device there, then try again."
msgstr "O Home Assistant não conseguiu que as luzes fizessem isso. Verifique o dispositivo por lá e tente novamente."

